    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... Hold on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many men do I have?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Three squads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you and Monique?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We have other work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't even think about Darksteel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "text": "They also have their jobs to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the Union...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've figured it out, you'd do best to behave yourself and act like you don't know anything. You do want to live, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, with these three squads, I'm responsible for guarding the Major arena and serving as the early warning, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...for the battle of the Blood Knight and the Radiant Knight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...and with the possibility of coming face-to-face with a Silverlance Pegasus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright. Are you asking me to commit suicide...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't put it that way. Just don't do anything, and you'll be fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How much longer are you going to use me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013I'm glad you're so self-aware.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
