        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Kazimierz is like a tower.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going to happen to me after the Major is over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#2",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Depends on your performance. If you're just asking me though, at least...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd prefer to let you live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Roy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_209_1#2",
        "name2": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
