        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already brought things to this step, doing whatever you feel like, with no concern for others' opinions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever thought of all the people you're harming through your juvenile actions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever considered that Marcin and the others will now be at the mercy of the Armorless Union?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever considered that Maria and Zofia may no longer be able to live safely in the Grand Knight Territory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may hold your own ideals in a vacuum, Margaret, but remember this: Your greatest mistake is trying to determine the trajectories of other peoples' lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is not a soul who has that right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am extremely disappointed in you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria, tell me the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I rob you of your dreams?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "You handed both the family name and the right to enter the tournament to me... You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret! That's never crossed my mind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... don't think I'm cut out to be a knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm listening, Maria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been so long since I've heard you... confide in someone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... don't understand what you're doing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been doubting... what the point of a knight even is anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we stand victorious in the arena, what is it the audience cheers for? What have we won?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if... you wanted to beat them at their own game, to defeat those rogues who want to keep you from winning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if they let you win because they get something out of it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or, what if they were never beholden to the rules of the game in the first place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the beginning, they never had an ounce of concern about the knights. This, I already knew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no meaning to me becoming the champion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "But to those watching us... it means the world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria, if you think this city \u2013 this country \u2013\u00a0is sick, what do you think is the root cause of the illness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "The corruption of the Adeptus Sprawiedliwi? The General Chamber of Commerce's endless expansion and exploitation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might be either, or even both.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "We often say that Kazimierz needs to regain its former glory, and every so often, someone needs to remind it what glory and justice are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is not just the knights who need to recover that glory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victory is not about defeating some enemy. 'To be a knight is to be the noble light that illuminates the land..'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1014_nearl2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But after illuminating the path forward, clearing the thorns, and filling up the pitfalls...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "A knight should have taught all those who seek freedom to overcome hardship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
