    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally awake, huh? Took you long enough. Thought you were dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You're a Sarkaz...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you can talk. Looks like you're doing better than your brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Withered Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, he's not dead either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "This special salve is usually used for armor repair. So this is what happens when you apply it directly to humans...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "The principle behind it is activation? What exactly do Kazimierz suits of armor have in common with humans? Both humans and armor can be activated? Then, what about Originium slugs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You're a de-horned Sarkaz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... with the Armorless Union?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, I'll take that as a compliment. Those guys make three thousand times more than I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a bounty hunter. I'm here in the Grand Knight Territory on a bit of business, as well as... a little investigation related to the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, it's nothing official. Just a personal curiosity of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013Have you seen any other Sarkaz with trimmed horns?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who cut off yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who would use... the Sarkaz... as slaves and test subjects?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right. I suppose you've been whipped pretty thoroughly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Want to come with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Big guys like you should be able to help out with some handy work, right? We're camped in the wastelands, and we're lacking hands more than anything else\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_102_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corrupted Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_213_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013Come with me, Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me, and you just might survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Toland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
