    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Batbayar...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You poor lad. Your folks won't even pay the bills for you when you're in the hospital.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "But your body is undoubtedly sturdy. Anyone else in your position wouldn't have much life left in them after a bout with the Blood Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you're an independent knight, you should've at least had some money saved up from making it to the semifinals. Where'd it all go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 80,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop moving around. Your wounds are deep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, hold on! Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm leaving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "A golden pegasus, a crimson Minoan. I... I've gained much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're unhappy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, I failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't fear failure anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't be afraid to retreat anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't fear... the beauty of weakness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But I am still lacking... I have yet to finish my Khaganquest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Khaganquest this, Khaganquest that... Do you even know where you're going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even in ancient times, it's not like there was a path you were supposed to follow for years, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "North.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the distant north... the echoing north where my ancestors disappeared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And after you make your way there, then what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you going to come back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nightmare Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_225",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You... I assumed you were searching for something you were missing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it turns out... are you searching for a place to die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
